{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><figure><img src=\"https://cdn3.am730.com.hk/processed/2025-12/1065988/block/singleImage/3279453/df/11-4_3.jpg?updatedAt=1795701018\"/><figcaption>男工送往廣華醫院治理。</figcaption></figure><p>旺角發生火警。今日(26日)下午5時許，警方及消防接報，指登打士街翠園大樓有棚網起火。消防接報趕至現場，動用一喉一煙帽隊迅速將火救熄。意外中一名55歲男工受傷，清醒送往廣華醫院治理。</p><p>警方經初步調查後，將案件列作「火警」及「有人意外受傷」處理。消防處表示，火警成因相信為有工人於大廈外牆進行水喉工程時，燒着雜物所致，現場並無進行燒焊工程。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-26T14:43:59.604062+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":181,"images":1,"source":"am730","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-26T13:50:18+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-27T06:17:13.409293+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-26T14:37:20.173858+00:00","content_hash":"deb68105c469cfad32deb28e0aed5ce897069f47c188926e41df7b7bf16ed34e","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-26T14:43:59.604062+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}